      "content": "it's just hard to find a reason to keep fighting when even the memory of it will be gone soon enough. it feels like everything we are is just built on sand. if the end is inevitable and it's going to be this ugly, why is there even a moral weight to staying? is it really any better to stay for the wreckage than to find some peace early?",
